WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.893
- True or false, there are
ghosts in the White House?

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.633
- True.

00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:06.530
- Ah, never going.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.720
- True and listen, Kelly, you
would have liked these ghosts

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.940
'cause they were very musical.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.730
They were musical and came with no harm.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.430
They were kind, friendly,
compassionate ghosts.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.480
So, Barbara and I were going to sleep,

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.550
our rooms were right next to each other

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.650
and it was in college when
people would call late.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.440
So our phone rang and I
woke up and all of a sudden

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:32.440
we heard like 1920s piano music
coming out of our fireplace.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.260
And I was like, surely that's
like the cat or something.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.270
You know, we had to pretend,

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.800
but it was the middle of the night

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.150
and you could feel the
music out of the fireplace.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.130
And I know, we tried to talk
ourselves out of it too.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:44.440
like I can see you.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:45.560
What do you think?

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.730
- Um, what I think is I
would have immediately

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.010
exited the premises. (laughs)

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:53.210
- We jumped into each other's beds.

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:54.110
- Oh.
- We were terrified,

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:56.840
but I'm telling you,
the ghosts were musical

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.410
and they came with no harm.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.510
- I know, but--
- They weren't evil.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:01.300
- You say 1920s piano music

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.051
and that is literally
like a horror film to me,

00:01:04.051 --> 00:01:05.180
(audience laughs)
like late in the night,

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:08.250
like that kind of music is
like when you die, generally.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.660
- Like jazz piano, jazz piano,

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:12.690
but I mean, you know you can't imagine

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:16.000
what's happened there, so I
think it was from another era,

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.780
but it was definitely terrifying.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:19.000
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:19.990
Yeah, no, I'm good.

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:20.823
I've been there once.

00:01:20.823 --> 00:01:22.593
I definitely won't be visiting again.

